    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u2026\u2026\u4F46\u5373\u4F7F\u83B7\u5F97\u4E86\u98DF\u7269\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u8FD8\u662F\u9700\u8981\u653E\u5F03\u540C\u4F34\u6765\u6362\u53D6\u66F4\u591A\u7684\u65F6\u95F4\u3002"
    en: ...But even after getting food, we still had to sacrifice one of our own
      to buy us a little more time to survive.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
